# Org exports. Item and credit reports carry item titles, owner usernames and
# client project names, and this repo is public. publish.bat runs "git add -A",
# so anything left in the working folder would be pushed. Keep exports outside
# the repo; this is the second line of defense, not the first.
*.csv
*.xlsx
reports/
org-reports/
